        "original_id": "6e0c6b49-ac0f-5217-9518-a24d6a6a0667",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Saraghrar, Trivor, Gilgit-Baltistan, Pakistan\n- Mountain ranges: Hispar Muztagh, Karakoram\n- Topics: summit identification, expedition reports\n\nFacts:\n- Saraghrar has distinct summits that are poorly identified.\n- Information from expeditions that have visited the Saraghrar area is often misleading.\n- Trivor is one of the high peaks of the Hispar Muztagh.\n- The Hispar Muztagh is a subrange of the Karakoram range.\n- Trivor is in Gilgit-Baltistan, Pakistan.",
